{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped in what seems to be an endless hospital department. Carefully observe your surroundings in each loop to escape the Liminal Department</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Phenomenon Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever-changing hallway filled with unusual occurrences. Each loop could have multiple anomalies or none. Some are easy to spot, others are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/d73ac64f14f813ac458f1d6cef625a98.poster.avif?t=1765189406\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/d73ac64f14f813ac458f1d6cef625a98.webm?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/d73ac64f14f813ac458f1d6cef625a98.mp4?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VHS Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS tape style mode with zooming feature. Experience a nostalgic liminal feel with the old classic camera interface and visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/faa28b3d6918ea2d9263106a394d7097.poster.avif?t=1765189406\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/faa28b3d6918ea2d9263106a394d7097.webm?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/faa28b3d6918ea2d9263106a394d7097.mp4?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Submit for Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a careful\u00a0examination submit for anomalies to proceed further. Memory skills are key to breaking the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/5e7d83025666fa1a884aa83a2e196443.poster.avif?t=1765189406\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/5e7d83025666fa1a884aa83a2e196443.webm?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/5e7d83025666fa1a884aa83a2e196443.mp4?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trapped In a Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in a never-ending loop, leaving the department only leads you right back into the same hallway.\u00a0Reach department 13 to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/fd9f67b39c5e3d38e346fe6587cf8963.poster.avif?t=1765189406\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/fd9f67b39c5e3d38e346fe6587cf8963.webm?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/fd9f67b39c5e3d38e346fe6587cf8963.mp4?t=1765189406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic and eerie experience with minimal UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS mode with zooming feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera bobbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Break The Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/45edfbe2d3732615cd87c08601a5c10881bf12ba.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/678e5ce5533fc01c0640815a9c8cb62ac52cd2f3.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/78185acf3f8c9eac1f17de3104debb48a3d39563.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/fc42fe6b4e5aced3cefd28de37ea909e2a15862b.jpg"},{"name":"CCTV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/e44032d4aeb3d9939586e2b6fa9d9462becc86e3.jpg"},{"name":"The Isolated Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/83a842cda5ab45d7aec6825ab793cd869c597e3b.jpg"},{"name":"Terror Hallway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/5ccac78204d94cfb0d3cf616055df2d90cea3566.jpg"},{"name":"Snowy Department","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/7279ff5d8f4818a2b5df4c09af05248863fc39b1.jpg"},{"name":"The Waiting Person","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/97af27f54d90366dc4b295281d07a38e6a5fcbd9.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Stretcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/8c52427854ba6f3b81816453479095e0a3a2bf93.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412000?t=1765189406","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412000?t=1765189406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c